name multilang
category Package
revision 49065
shortdesc A LaTeX package for maintaining multiple translations of a document
relocated 1
longdesc Maintaining a LaTeX document with translations for multiple
longdesc languages can be cumbersome and error-prone. This package
longdesc provides a set of macros for defining macros and environments
longdesc as wrappers around existing macros and environments. These
longdesc wrappers allow one to clearly specify multiple translations for
longdesc the arguments to the wrapped macros and environments while only
longdesc the translation of the document's language is actually shown.
longdesc Choosing a translation then is as simple as choosing the
longdesc document's language via babel or polyglossia.
runfiles size=5
